**Tailwind's Numbering System**

- 1 rem is equal to the size of the base font of the document, usually 16px.

Assuming the base font size of the document is 16px

| **Pixels** | **rem** | **Tailwind** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 0px | 0 rem | 0 |
| 4px | 0.25 rem | 1 |
| 8px | 0.5 rem | 2 |
| 12px | 0.75 rem | 3 |
| 16px | 1 rem | 4 |
| 20px | 1.25 rem | 5 |

Continues to all of the available default sizes 6, 8, 10, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56, 64.

